{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1663286400, "end_date": 1663977599, "month_true_total": 402, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:49:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "122708460", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116934331", "personaname": "Mad Mouth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198116934331/", "num_games_owned": 388, "num_reviews": 114, "playtime_forever": 62445, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42631, "last_played": 1677330401, "avatar": "a759e3dc5ada05651ccb53f2933581199ee25610"}, "language": "english", "review": "the game was better when you had to draw cards. much more tension. sure lots of times we had to fail to improve but that was part of teh dance. the characters are all unlikable too. very horrible dialogue. the gmaes a decent FPS and tahts all it will ever be.", "timestamp_created": 1663970003, "timestamp_updated": 1663970003, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.313634872436523438", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "122708306", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026000718", "personaname": "Zhasmin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198026000718/", "num_games_owned": 166, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 4490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3429, "last_played": 1754090937, "avatar": "929c6d07f5ba98f94b535a57c6d1019b4bafb891"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game used to be fun but sadly they dont update the game anymore. everyone(mainly normies that dont play games for more then an hour) compaired it to l4d2 instead of looking and playing it for what it was (the false advertising didnt help too) it had basic unreal gunplay and the cards were fun to use n the campign was fun and went somewhere (untill it didnt/them stop updating the game)", "timestamp_created": 1663969743, "timestamp_updated": 1723961889, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122705650", "author": {"steamid": "76561198209886619", "personaname": "Peppr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PepprSpice/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 39258, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36619, "last_played": 1762810622, "avatar": "6796cf53d1b12f7e70b34f2d02f69a41e1de3d81"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pubs are room temperature IQ and in general ruin the experience of everyone in the lobby. Try to avoid Quickplay unless you're a masochist. One braindead person can screw over the entire team, and they do at every opportunity.\n\nGame is fun with friends/competent teammates.", "timestamp_created": 1663965891, "timestamp_updated": 1663965891, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480755031108856201", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "122704797", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012548028", "personaname": "[TCB] Boss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Earl_Sr/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 1981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1907, "last_played": 1689045265, "avatar": "18b87dca14a21a72bc637f204aa3c0d1f4c22b5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "\nA cacohpony of chaos and backspawning zombies at the hands of the makers...have they played their own game?\n\nI've tried enjoying this product over and over again, even with all the hours I've invested, however the pacing and backspawning are relentless.\n\nThe semplance of any spatial deconstruction like \"Left for Dead\" is completly gone. As if this was a newbie's version of what gameplay is supposed to feel like.\n\nI'll change my review, if they can get their pacing down and not throw endless zombies spawning in from the ether.\n", "timestamp_created": 1663964647, "timestamp_updated": 1663964647, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493050456047058105", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122700686", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061221948", "personaname": "Puddy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PuddyHU/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 100, "playtime_forever": 113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 88, "last_played": 1664703533, "avatar": "b178833c8c5d554a7e4a3b4089accf1204f8a028"}, "language": "english", "review": "Like Left 4 Dead, if Left 4 Dead was made by brainless monkeys", "timestamp_created": 1663959498, "timestamp_updated": 1663959498, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518489062786102295", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}